Hi,

a new experimental Linux driver for NCT6775F, NCT6776F, and NCT6779D is available
from https://github.com/groeck/nct6775.

The driver adds support for NCT6779D, and provides improved fan control support.

So far it has only been only tested with NCT6775F. Please test (especially for NCT6776F
and NCT6779D) and report.

Thanks,
Guenter

